         <p>BOSTON:<lb/>BROWN, TAGGARD &amp; CHASE.<lb/>1857.</p>
         <p>Entered according to Act of Congress, in the year 1857, by<lb/>
            <lb/>ANNA E. TOWER,<lb/>
