               <p rend="justify">   Here is a man in the rain. He is by the tree. He will be wet to the skin. I see his line, but I do not see a fish yet. Look at him! How close he is now to the old tree.</p>
               <p rend="justify">Jane skating with long stick; John drawing Kate on the sled</p>
